+4. **Account / Contact merge** ΓÇö remains `NOT_AVAILABLE` (Lead + Opportunity merge executed)
+5. **Email / WhatsApp ΓåÆ Lead ingest** ΓÇö still `NOT_AVAILABLE`
+6. **Lead ΓåÆ Tenant conversion transaction** ΓÇö CARRY (Closed Won Γëá provision)
+7. **Prisma generate / db push on Windows** ΓÇö schema + SQL ready; apply when EPERM clears
+8. **Rich duplicates admin UI** ΓÇö thin stub; Opportunity duplicate APIs exist
+
+## Exit readiness
+
+**READY_FOR_PHASE_13_WITH_BLOCKERS** ΓÇö Phase 12 Waves 1ΓÇô4 deliver honest Pipeline/Opportunity ops including EXPANSION/MRA_EIS, import, currency-separated reports, and SoD merge; weighted forecasting UI, full scope filtering, and provisioning/conversion remain explicit carry blockers.
